  "native_rules": [
    "Combo2 merges at the moving item cell, hides/detaches the TNT, assigns its typed strategy and starts moveType8.",
    "Targeting chooses the most-common unreserved color; original shuffled, timed pooled rays convert live match models to lightball-created TNT models.",
    "Conversion recycles the old view without match explosion or goal decrement; the new TNT receives current/target mediation and the existing ray explosion lifetime.",
    "After collection stops, the original partner replaces the lightball and owns its cell freeze, shake and background until explosion.",
    "Every converted TNT ignores non-trigger15 hits. All rays finish before native fuse animation and one shared .5 gameplay-second wait followed by collective trigger15.",
    "TNT conversion animation starts at native normalized time0.3103448152542114; existing prefab animations, fuse masks, sprite sorting, pools and explosion/refill owners are reused.",
    "Combo2 increments once, lightball creation count uses items.Count+1, special operation finishes and moveType9 completes.",
    "WaitForGameplaySeconds consumes delta per coroutine poll while the level clock advances in LateUpdate; verification reads accumulated wait duration rather than requiring equal wall-clock subtraction.",
    "DefaultLightballStrategy.StoppedLookingForNewItems is a native ret-only body. Its shared callback does not add default-strategy behavior.",
    "Read-only straight/cross planner queries permit only destroyed original-box cavities that the native planner cannot refill, independent of which replay phase is active."
